.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK USER ACTIVITY"
.SH NAME
hamstik user activity \- Show a user's visible activity (newest first)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik user activity [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show a user's visible activity (newest first)
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I PUBLIC_ID
The user's public ID (usr_...)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --since
Only events strictly after this RFC 3339 timestamp
.TP
.B --limit
Maximum items per page (endpoint maximum is 100 or 200)
.TP
.B --cursor
Opaque continuation cursor
.TP
.B --all
Follow all pages
Choices: true, false
